This product includes a Python adaptation of the deterministic line-resolution
algorithm from Open Code Review:

  Project: Open Code Review
  Source: https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review
  Reference revision: c9b145635c6b6343b108941c2a627ac636836c6b
  Reference file: internal/diff/resolver.go
  Copyright 2026 Alibaba
  License: Apache License 2.0

The adapted implementation is located at:

  src/codelens/review/infrastructure/line_resolver.py

CodeLens rewrote the Go implementation in Python and integrated it with an
immutable ReviewSnapshot. It also adds Snapshot path and content validation,
new-side changed-hunk containment, and derived hunk/excerpt identities. See
the repository's docs/open-code-review-comparison.md for the implementation
comparison.

